      "reason": "认证所需 trusted-key 不能仅从已配置共享密钥推定；题干需明确它已预配置。",
      "updates": {
        "prompt": "On a Cisco IOS device, an administrator must configure a unicast NTP client to authenticate a server. Assume the matching shared authentication key is already configured on both devices, the key ID is trusted on the client, and IP reachability exists. Which two remaining tasks are needed among the following? (Choose two.)",
        "explanation": "A、C。匹配的共享密钥和客户端 trusted-key 已按题设预配置；启用 `ntp authenticate`，并用 `ntp server <address> key <id>` 指定单播服务器和相应密钥。缺少匹配密钥、受信 key ID 或网络可达性时，仅做 A/C 仍不足以完成认证。B 时区只影响本地显示；D 非对称私钥不是题设对称认证配置；E 关闭广播不是配置单播认证的必要步骤。普通未认证 NTP 客户端无需仅因服务器可信而强制启用认证。"
      }
    }
  ],
